# Text files are LF everywhere, in the repo and in the working tree. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# `core.autocrlf=true` writes CRLF, while Prettier writes LF, so `bun run format:check` reports every file the developer
# hasn't run `bun run format` over — a difference no commit can fix, because git normalises it away.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fonts and images are bytes, never line endings.
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
